CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/h com/corrodinggames/rts/game/ProjectileMetadataMutator
	COMMENT ProjectileMetadataMutator - a conditional damage modifier of a projectile, built from the "mutator&lt;name&gt;_*" ini keys: ifUnitWithTags / ifUnitWithoutTags (at least one required, CustomTag), directDamageMultiplier, areaDamageMultiplier, addResourcesDirectHit (CustomPrice, incompatible with targetGround), addResourcesAreaHit (requires areaRadius) and changedExplodeEffect (EffectReference). Field names come from the ini key names parsed in ProjectileTemplate. [field names verified from the ini parser]
	FIELD a ifUnitWithTags Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/h;
	FIELD b ifUnitWithoutTags Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/h;
	FIELD c directDamageMultiplier F
	FIELD d areaDamageMultiplier F
	FIELD e addResourcesDirectHit Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/d/b;
	FIELD f addResourcesAreaHit Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/d/b;
	FIELD g changedExplodeEffect Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/z;
